{
  "key": "gh-1262",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "gh-1249 follow-up: deduplicate aiTeammateTokenUsageReporter.js internal self-clones (45 duplicated lines, pinned at 2.35%)",
    "description": "Follow-up from PR #1256 (gh-1249) review thread PRRT_kwDORYAuYs6v70RU.

The gh-1249 ticket/PR title names aiTeammateTokenUsageReporter.js, but the file's remaining duplication is INTERNAL self-clones (not the cross-file copy-paste family gh-1249 deduplicated):

- js/aiTeammateTokenUsageReporter.js:430-434 ↔ :446-449 and :456-468 ↔ :962-974 — the buildUsageCsv / buildAttemptsCsv builder pair (near-identical CSV serialization, ~13-line extent)
- :1206-1210 ↔ :1240-1244 — a second 5-line self-pair

45 duplicated lines total, pinned in duplication-baseline.json at 2.35%. The gh-1244-era token-usage transport dedup (tokenUsageComment.postRunTokenUsageSafely) does not cover these — they are same-file clones, so the gh-1249 cross-file dedup legitimately excluded the file.

DoD: extract the shared CSV-row serialization (and the second self-pair) so the file drops under the 1% duplication gate, then prune the duplication-baseline.json pin."
  }
}---
